cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this report or the indicators, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "RedTail Across Five Vectors: One Campaign Observed on a T-Pot Honeypot, September 2026"
authors:
  - family-names: Bischoff
    given-names: Thaddäus
version: v1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "A single T-Pot honeypot recorded one continuous RedTail campaign between 2026-09-16 and 2026-09-28 on five vectors: SSH, Telnet, HTTP, HTTPS and the Docker API. The report documents the evidence for one operation, the Telnet infection path, the detection gap under the ET Open ruleset, and recommendations for defenders."
keywords:
  - RedTail
  - honeypot
  - T-Pot
  - cryptominer
  - threat intelligence
  - indicators of compromise
repository-code: "https://github.com/TBjunior/redtail-analysis"
